@*  IMG-002 Wrapping Dashboard user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">IMG-002 · DASHBOARD</div>
        <div class="help-sub">감싸기 라인 실시간 대시보드 — WO 진척 + 본드 파라미터 + 시간별 생산</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">IMG-002 · STATION · LINE</text>

            @* ① WO + Equip row *@
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="14" y="68" width="410" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">▼ WO PROGRESS</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="130" style="font-size:32px;">98</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="120" y="130">/ 240 EA  ·  41%</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="170">FABRIC · COLOR · RECIPE · CYCLE</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            <rect class="hs-region warn" x="436" y="68" width="270" height="120" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="448" y="88">▼ EQUIPMENT</text>
            <circle cx="500" cy="138" r="14" fill="#22c55e" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="528" y="144">RUN</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="448" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="448" y="78">2</text>

            @* ② Bond grid 3 tiles *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14"  y="202" width="226" height="88" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="222">BOND PRESSURE</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="40" y="262" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#86efac">2.8</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="100" y="262">bar</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="248" y="202" width="226" height="88" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="262" y="222">BOND TEMP</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="274" y="262" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#86efac">82</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="318" y="262">°C</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="482" y="202" width="224" height="88" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="496" y="222">HOLD TIME</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="508" y="262" style="font-size:24px;" fill="#86efac">12</text>
            <text class="hs-sub" x="558" y="262">s</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="212" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="212">3</text>

            @* ③ Gauges + chart *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14"  y="304" width="226" height="60" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="324">DEFECT RATE</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="28" y="354" style="font-size:18px;" fill="#86efac">0.0%</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="248" y="304" width="226" height="60" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="262" y="324">FABRIC REMAINING</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="262" y="354" style="font-size:18px;" fill="#86efac">340 m</text>

            <rect class="hs-region dim" x="482" y="304" width="224" height="60" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="496" y="324">OEE</text>
            <text class="hs-label" x="496" y="354" style="font-size:18px;" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.4)">—</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="314" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="314">4</text>

            @* ④ hourly *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="378" width="692" height="50" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="398">HOURLY OUTPUT · 시간별 (target 20/h)</text>
            @for (var i = 0; i < 12; i++)
            {
                var h = new[] {35,40,45,55,58,60,55,50,40,30,18,8}[i];
                var fill = i == 6 ? "#fbbf24" : i > 6 ? "rgba(255,255,255,.18)" : "#22c55e";
                <rect x="@(38 + i * 54)" y="@(420 - h/2)" width="40" height="@(h/2)" rx="2" fill="@fill" />
            }

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ READ THE SCREEN · 화면 읽기</div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">WO progress with FABRIC / COLOR / RECIPE / CYCLE info row.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">WO 진척 + 원단/컬러/레시피/사이클 정보.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Equipment LED. Red? — go to INJ-008 Andon equivalent.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">설비 LED. 빨강이면 안돈 호출.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Bond recipe params — Pressure / Temp / Hold-time. Out-of-spec turns yellow/red.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">본드 레시피 파라미터 — 압력/온도/유지시간. 스펙 이탈 시 색 변화.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">4</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">3 mini-gauges + hourly output chart.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">3개 게이지 + 시간별 생산 차트.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section-h">▶ COMMON TASKS · 자주 쓰는 작업</div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">A</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en"><strong>Mount fabric roll</strong> — IMG-004 (signature screen).</div><div class="help-step-ko"><strong>원단 장착</strong> — IMG-004.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">B</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en"><strong>Adjust bond recipe</strong> — IMG-006.</div><div class="help-step-ko"><strong>본드 레시피 조정</strong> — IMG-006.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step bad"><div class="help-step-num">C</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en"><strong>Log defect</strong> — IMG-005.</div><div class="help-step-ko"><strong>불량 등록</strong> — IMG-005.</div></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
